{"data": [{"author_id": "2115649308448133120", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118512308167311766"], "id": "2118512308167311766", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 字幕字体除了好看，建议顺手看一眼许可证。不同字体的商用、嵌入视频规则不一样，开源不等于什么场景都能用，发视频前先确认最省事。", "url": "https://x.com/lilimg4614/status/2118512308167311766"}, {"author_id": "1499198533106540546", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:14:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118512244082491869"], "id": "2118512244082491869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 AI 能自动生成字幕，唯独搞不定字体审美，最后还得靠人类一句“这个怎么这么丑”。", "url": "https://x.com/ajutqs/status/2118512244082491869"}, {"author_id": "1854003829567799296", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:13:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118511985042350591"], "id": "2118511985042350591", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 字幕中文字体一丑，录屏软件就得自己找字体包。开源合集把选型成本压成搜一次，产品体验的短板常常卡在这种默认字体细节上。", "url": "https://x.com/ffixx22722/status/2118511985042350591"}, {"author_id": "2115456440232275968", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:06:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118510368112673077"], "id": "2118510368112673077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 改 Cap 字幕发现中文字体丑，一搜就有人把开源字体合集整理好了\n这种仓库真的救命", "url": "https://x.com/NextTokenCN/status/2118510368112673077"}, {"author_id": "2042983655501434880", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:04:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118509872081998078"], "id": "2118509872081998078", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 这个不错，我也要赶快把我的软件字体替换了", "url": "https://x.com/mufenglabs/status/2118509872081998078"}, {"author_id": "2087048135759605760", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:03:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118509509136285734"], "id": "2118509509136285734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 刚收藏了。做中文录屏/字幕最崩溃的就是一堆英文字体硬撑，字形稀碎。这种合集比再找十个「AI 生图提示词」实用一百倍，直接能进工具箱。", "url": "https://x.com/Joinpzr/status/2118509509136285734"}, {"author_id": "3122661542", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:02:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118509328110096472"], "id": "2118509328110096472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 107, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 做的话可以让Agent支持调用它去录屏\n我现在showcase都是AI自己录的\n但效果相对差一些", "url": "https://x.com/yangyi/status/2118509328110096472"}, {"author_id": "318935590", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:57:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118508120011841558"], "id": "2118508120011841558", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 字幕中文字体一丑直接没法看，先存了", "url": "https://x.com/yafeishi/status/2118508120011841558"}, {"author_id": "49928235", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:53:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118507053714907620"], "id": "2118507053714907620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 做站的时候中文字体真是个坑，好看的要不贵要不授权乱，开源合集整理好了直接能用真省心哈哈", "url": "https://x.com/masling/status/2118507053714907620"}, {"author_id": "2054800349408768000", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:53:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118507021087776954"], "id": "2118507021087776954", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 录屏字幕里中文难看，多半不是软件丑，是字体字符集和度量不齐。\n\n我会这么挑：\n1. 优先 Noto Sans SC / Source Han Sans 这类全字符集，半角全角、中英混排不容易炸\n2. 字重别超过工程实际支持的范围，太细在 1080p 压缩后会糊\n3. 导出前全片 scrub 一遍中文标点——半角逗号、省略号最容易错位", "url": "https://x.com/wangchuan0056/status/2118507021087776954"}, {"author_id": "1442361250285953027", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:39:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118503550179533000"], "id": "2118503550179533000", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 中文字幕这一关卡死多少录屏软件了，有合集真省事。", "url": "https://x.com/MaoHeShui_Web3/status/2118503550179533000"}, {"author_id": "1825556649723240448", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:39:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118503410769039548"], "id": "2118503410769039548", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 Cap 字幕那个丑字体我也忍过，这合集来得正是时候", "url": "https://x.com/JMkernt/status/2118503410769039548"}, {"author_id": "2089808296748171264", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:38:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118503349880582311"], "id": "2118503349880582311", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 字幕中文字体丑了好久，这合集来得刚好", "url": "https://x.com/NorthAmericaAI/status/2118503349880582311"}, {"author_id": "329567918", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:36:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118502717639540893"], "id": "2118502717639540893", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 是的，中文字幕字体一向难搞。有人把开源中文字体合集整理好了，改录屏软件的直接抄作业", "url": "https://x.com/SeenFirstCN/status/2118502717639540893"}, {"author_id": "243124464", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:34:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118502278084919426"], "id": "2118502278084919426", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 这个合集及时。我改产品介绍视频字幕，中文字体经常崩，收藏了。", "url": "https://x.com/iJimmyChan/status/2118502278084919426"}, {"author_id": "301985414", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118500903464427561"], "id": "2118500903464427561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 字幕字体一丑，整条录屏就掉档，这份开源合集正好补上。", "url": "https://x.com/SuperEdisonX/status/2118500903464427561"}, {"author_id": "1988851885118484480", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:28:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118500639013847207"], "id": "2118500639013847207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 这个合集来得太及时了，我之前也被 Cap 的中文字幕丑到过，换字体还得一个个找。思源、台北黑体这些全列在一起带授权协议，挑起来省事多了，先收藏了。", "url": "https://x.com/taiyanghere/status/2118500639013847207"}, {"author_id": "1881945875658014720", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:21:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118499095623221375"], "id": "2118499095623221375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 Cap录屏自带的中文字体确实太丑了，这个开源字体合集用起来方便太多了。", "url": "https://x.com/_luckyj888/status/2118499095623221375"}, {"author_id": "1003569530843492352", "conversation_id": "2118498521712316782", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:21:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118499050328875439"], "id": "2118499050328875439", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 太好了 馬上更新我的Skill", "url": "https://x.com/ChrisHKAI/status/2118499050328875439"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2115649308448133120", "name": "遇灵枯木封甘", "username": "lilimg4614"}, {"id": "1499198533106540546", "name": "Ajut Q", "username": "ajutqs"}, {"id": "1854003829567799296", "name": "Nigel | Totalix.Ai", "username": "ffixx22722"}, {"id": "2115456440232275968", "name": "潜空间 | Next Token", "username": "NextTokenCN"}, {"id": "2042983655501434880", "name": "沐风", "username": "mufenglabs"}, {"id": "2087048135759605760", "name": "Join", "username": "Joinpzr"}, {"id": "3122661542", "name": "Yangyi", "username": "yangyi"}, {"id": "318935590", "name": "Hobson", "username": "yafeishi"}, {"id": "49928235", "name": "Theo Ma 老马", "username": "masling"}, {"id": "2054800349408768000", "name": "忘川", "username": "wangchuan0056"}, {"id": "1442361250285953027", "name": "猫喝水", "username": "MaoHeShui_Web3"}, {"id": "1825556649723240448", "name": "jimerrors", "username": "JMkernt"}, {"id": "2089808296748171264", "name": "北美AI现场", "username": "NorthAmericaAI"}, {"id": "329567918", "name": "SeenFirstCN", "username": "SeenFirstCN"}, {"id": "243124464", "name": "Jimmy｜A股·AI·出海", "username": "iJimmyChan"}, {"id": "301985414", "name": "EdisonX", "username": "SuperEdisonX